      "name": "Spiff",
      "username": "Spiff",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-08-28T17:30:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've only watched the first two episodes but I found it to be odd -- not goofy enough to actually be goofy, not serious enough to be serious. &nbsp;It was kind of hovering in the middle not really sure what it was. &nbsp;The guy playing Tick didn't seem to want to go full-cartoony and Arthur has a tragic backstory now. &nbsp;There wasn't enough there for me to want to keep watching, I'm sad to say.</p>",
