      "created_at": "2018-01-09T17:45:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You can look forward to 6 more at some point in the future!  As opposed to the past</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The future starts on February 23rd apparently.</p>\n<p>I'm disappointed (and surprised) that so much time has passed between the first 6 and this 6, I think they've let it lie fallow for too long. I barely remember what happened last time now.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>EDIT: Though there is a new teaser video <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/list/ls053181649/videoplayer/vi4176525337?ref_=hm_hp_i_1\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a></p>",
