      "created_at": "2018-02-28T12:43:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I binged the new 6 last night, I thought this half was far better than the first.&nbsp;</p><p>I loved the flashback early/avalanche jokes, it was good to have a spoon reference, and I think there was more characterisation of the secondary characters here.</p><p>All in all a good start to a new version of the Tick, I llok forward to teh second season.</p>",
